          "description": "Amber containment beacons spin along the vault ceiling. Elena pulls the scorched Chrono-Compass free and engages the uplink lever as the blast doors begin to close."
        },
        {
          "element_type": "character",
          "uuid": "bd794c70-61d5-463c-90ed-269c5767da81",
